      method(): ReturnType;
    }
</code></pre>
We parse the typescript to JSON Schema, then use that to generate runtime validation across both JS implementations and other languages.<p>Typescript is a really nice IDL. I didn&#x27;t want to hitch our wagon to something else like typespec.io even if that would have given us more things out of the box.
